meta {
  name: add entry
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/collection/entries
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "set_code": "ECL",
    "collector_number": "166",
    "language_code": "FR",
    "foil": false,
    "quantity": 1,
    "binder_id": null,
    "sealed_product_id": null,
    "purchase_price": null
  }
}

docs {
  `201`. Merges into the existing entry of the same card, finish and binder. Set `binder_id` to
  `{{binderId}}` to store the copies in a binder. Set `sealed_product_id` to `{{purchaseId}}` to
  attach them to one of your sealed products: no purchase price, and the card joins its content.
  Set `purchase_price` (cents per copy) to give the copies a price and record a single card
  purchase of price × quantity, dated today; leave it null for no purchase. The two are exclusive
  (`invalid_request`, 400). `card_not_in_catalog` (404), `purchase_not_found` (404, also for a
  single card purchase), `invalid_quantity` (400, outside 1 to 255), `invalid_purchase_price`
  (400, 0 or less).
}
